---

Ported/adapted components and their origin:
- knowledge/persistence.py    <- rdagent/core/knowledge_base.py
- knowledge/vector_store.py   <- rdagent/components/knowledge_management/vector_base.py
- knowledge/graph.py          <- rdagent/components/knowledge_management/graph.py
- knowledge/screenshot.py     <- extract_first_page_screenshot_from_pdf() in
                                  rdagent/components/document_reader/document_reader.py
- llm/json_parser.py          <- JSONParser in rdagent/oai/backend/base.py

All other RD-Agent modules (langchain/Azure PDF loading, the litellm-backed
APIBackend cost/token machinery, the proposal/evaluation/interactor
templates) were deliberately NOT ported — see
docs/RD-AGENT-EXTRACTION-PASS0.md for the overlap analysis and rationale.
Every file above has been substantially rewritten to remove all rdagent.*
coupling (logger, conf/settings, exceptions, singleton utils) and to route
through this project's own embedding provider (analyze/embed.py) and LLM
call layer (claude_cli.py) instead.
